<section class="hero hero-slim">
  <h1>How much does it cost?</h1>
  <p class="lede">Simple. You only pay when you actually book a job.</p>
</section>

<div class="plan-grid">
  <div class="card plan-card">
    <h2>Free</h2>
    <p class="plan-price">$0</p>
    <p class="muted">List your services and get customer requests.</p>
    <ul class="check-list">
      <li>Your own business page</li>
      <li>Get job requests and messages</li>
      <li>Send prices to customers</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="fee-line">When you book a job: <strong>10% fee</strong></p>
    <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/signup">Start free</a>
  </div>

  <div class="card plan-card plan-featured">
    <p class="plan-flag">Most popular</p>
    <h2>Pro</h2>
    <p class="plan-price">$39<span class="muted">/month</span></p>
    <p class="muted">Everything in Free, plus the tools to run your business.</p>
    <ul class="check-list">
      <li>Pick days and times for jobs</li>
      <li>Make and send bills</li>
      <li>Stand out to more customers</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="fee-line">When you book a job: <strong>5% fee</strong></p>
    <a class="btn btn-gold" href="/signup">Go Pro</a>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="card">
  <h2>How the fee works</h2>
  <ul class="plain-list">
    <li><strong>You only pay when you and the customer agree on a day and time.</strong> Chatting is always free.</li>
    <li>The fee is a small percent of the job price. Smallest fee is $5.</li>
    <li><strong>You always confirm the fee first.</strong> Nothing is ever charged without you pressing OK.</li>
    <li><strong>Job cancelled? No fee.</strong> If the job does not happen, you pay nothing.</li>
    <li>You need a card on file so fees can be collected. Card charging turns on when the site owner connects payments — until then fees are just tracked.</li>
  </ul>
</section>

<section class="card">
  <h2>Got a promo code?</h2>
  <p>We accept promo codes. Pros enter theirs on the <a href="/billing">billing page</a>; customers enter theirs when they sign up or on their dashboard. Codes can give free Pro time, jobs with no fee, or account credit.</p>
</section>
